## Folder structure (REQUIRED)

```
templates/<name>/
  00-readme-first.md        # human orientation; greppable claims only
  INDEX.md                  # machine-greppable map of every convention
  decision-log.md           # proposed / accepted / deprecated entries
  memory/                   # prose contracts per role + topic
    NN-<topic>-<role>.md    # NN = zero-padded 2-digit, monotonic
  skeleton/                 # reference implementation
    index.html
  prompts/                  # LLM-actionable prompts
    <stage>.md
  assets/
    MANIFEST.txt            # every line must resolve
    manifest.schema.json    # JSON Schema for MANIFEST
  tests/
    verify.sh               # grep-based self-check; CI-runnable
```

Recommended additions when the template ships motion or multi-locale content:

```
  motion/                   # motion tokens, easing curves, duration table
  locales/                  # per-locale overrides (font, numerals, direction)
```

Forbidden:

- Subdirectories without a README explaining what lives there
- Memory files outside `memory/` (controller memory is a different lane)
- Skeleton files outside `skeleton/` (one canonical entry point)

